864	/**
865	 *
866	 * This the Transmit handler callback function and will increment a
867	 *shared counter that can be shared by the main thread of
868	 *operation.
869	 *
870	 * @param	Callback is the pointer to the instance of the EmacPs
871	 *device.
872	 *
